    ["GetTrainerServiceDescription(86)"] = "1: string Summons a Windwall Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster.  The totem protects party members within 30 yards, reducing ranged damage taken by 32.  Lasts 5 min.",
    ["GetTrainerServiceDescription(87)"] = "1: string Summons a Disease Cleansing Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster that attempts to remove 1 disease effect from party members within 30 yards every 5 seconds.  Lasts 5 min.",
